            monoT r ψ (monoP 0 monoKPhi (L / 2) u₁) (monoP 1 monoKPsiA L u₂) z)
            1 volume ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (C * monoC20 ψ * L ^ (-σ) * B₁ * B₂)

